        "episode_id": "01835c28-431e-5b5a-adbb-5ec01411a299",
        "speaker_id": "person:speaker-02",
        "text": "Let me give you the version I actually believe. The best conversations refuse to resolve. I've watched this pattern hold across three different teams.",
